{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>In this massive pixel world, rediscover everything that makes RPGs great!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157170/extras/c9c302754e31eec3bd85c3bd0a2998b2.poster.avif?t=1758514645\" width=1028 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157170/extras/c9c302754e31eec3bd85c3bd0a2998b2.webm?t=1758514645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157170/extras/c9c302754e31eec3bd85c3bd0a2998b2.mp4?t=1758514645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Retro Heart, Modern Soul!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recraft the Golden Age of GBA</strong> \u2013 Travel back to that nostalgic afternoon, rekindle your love for pixel RPGs with modern craftsmanship and colossal content. Experience super-sized adventures with boundless freedom.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Vast Open World</strong> \u2013 Explore an open world with hundreds of enterable maps and diverse terrains. Embark on an epic journey like never before.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157170/extras/881c6465c7a709357e6c4458037f6fe8.avif?t=1758514645\" width=1520 height=1310 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore, Collect, Develop, and Crush Everything!</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157170/extras/901a531d773100cf7b28ff4280a7769c.poster.avif?t=1758514645\" width=1028 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157170/extras/901a531d773100cf7b28ff4280a7769c.webm?t=1758514645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157170/extras/901a531d773100cf7b28ff4280a7769c.mp4?t=1758514645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Collect. Train. Crush Everything!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>300+ Unique Characters</strong> \u2013 Collect hundreds of characters, each with unique stats, classes, races, traits, skills, and their own passive skill tree.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>60+ Unique Bosses</strong> \u2013 Get pumped! Face powerful bosses accompanied by rock and metal music. Test your strategy and strength, then display your defeated bosses in the museum.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157170/extras/9685f33404b0f0396bfc6614a53007f3.poster.avif?t=1758514645\" width=1028 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157170/extras/9685f33404b0f0396bfc6614a53007f3.webm?t=1758514645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157170/extras/9685f33404b0f0396bfc6614a53007f3.mp4?t=1758514645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1000+ Unique Equipment</strong> \u2013 Farm permanently collectible overpowered gear and enhance them to the limit! Experiment with endless build possibilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1000+ Unlockable Achievements</strong> \u2013 A dream for completionists! Pursue achievements as your goal and decorate your homepage with exquisite achievement cards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100+ Collectible Cards</strong> \u2013 Gather character cards to provide permanent buffs for your entire team. The growth never stops.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>200+ Collectible Soundtracks</strong> \u2013 Turn the data hall into your own DJ room.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157170/extras/caec0357533e93ec92b16f459467a2d3.poster.avif?t=1758514645\" width=1064 height=917 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157170/extras/caec0357533e93ec92b16f459467a2d3.webm?t=1758514645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157170/extras/f829f8dc2e6357041a12396235b13158.poster.avif?t=1758514645\" width=1028 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157170/extras/f829f8dc2e6357041a12396235b13158.webm?t=1758514645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157170/extras/f829f8dc2e6357041a12396235b13158.mp4?t=1758514645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>More than just combat\u2014you define how you play!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Gameplay</strong> \u2013 Explore every corner, challenge gyms, defeat NPCs, complete quests, or climb a RogueLike-style tower with 100 floors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4v4 High-Speed Turn-Based Combat</strong> \u2013 Build your team outside the battle, test it inside. One-minute matches full of strategy and excitement. Constantly experiment with new builds \u2013 always something fresh.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Idle Mode</strong> \u2013 Earn rewards through auto-battles and enjoy the thrill of electronic cricket fights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ambitious Developers</strong> \u2013 You\u2019re supported by an ambitious development team that\u2019s crazily dedicated to delivering new content until they go bald.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And More</strong> \u2013 This digital world holds even more secrets waiting for you to uncover.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157170/extras/00f5255f6fec5cf58acf36155dde6e0b.poster.avif?t=1758514645\" width=912 height=786 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157170/extras/00f5255f6fec5cf58acf36155dde6e0b.webm?t=1758514645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3157170?t=1758514645","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3157170?t=1758514645","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157170/13b660f81031df9f759231c120c12c11605969f9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758514645","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157170/13b660f81031df9f759231c120c12c11605969f9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758514645","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id"